<sect1 id="index_1cyqlone">
<title>Cyqlone</title><para>Fast, <bold>parallel and vectorized solver</bold> for linear systems with <bold>optimal control structure</bold>.</para>
<para>Also includes an implementation of the <bold>CyQPALM</bold> solver that uses the Cyqlone linear solver as a backend, with parallel factorization update routines to handle active set changes and a parallel exact line search.</para>
<sect2 id="index_1preprint">
<title>Preprint</title><para>The paper describing the algorithms in this repository can be found on arXiv: <ulink url="https://arxiv.org/abs/2512.09058"><bold>arxiv.org/abs/2512.09058</bold></ulink></para>
